    build scripts, and any accompanying files distributed
    under this license.

1.2 "Licensor" means the copyright holder(s) of the Software.

1.3 "Licensee" means any individual or legal entity exercising
    rights under this license.

1.4 "Authorized Use" means use of the Software:
      (a) on systems owned by the Licensee; or
      (b) on systems for which the Licensee holds explicit,
          prior, written authorization from the system owner
          that defines scope, time window, and permitted
          techniques; or
      (c) in a sanctioned Capture-the-Flag (CTF) competition,
          academic lab, or controlled research environment
          where such use is expressly permitted.

1.5 "Commercial Use" means any use of the Software in a
    product, service, or engagement that generates revenue,
    directly or indirectly, including but not limited to
    paid penetration testing, SaaS offerings, consulting,
    training, or integration into a commercial product.

